                                                "sense_id": "25e650f6-91c9-360a-8f80-1e599c52143e",
                                                "text": "The bolsters can be seen outboard of the hawseholes, and the way they are cut away to permit the passage of the anchor-cables."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "738c2e81-4ada-433a-83be-044109ee2499",
                                                "sense_id": "25e650f6-91c9-360a-8f80-1e599c52143e",
                                                "text": "Then he saw. a few feet aft of the hawsehole, a darker spot on the hull—someone had left a porthole open below the forecastle. in the hold that was the crews' quarters."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d77691e-38d4-4228-946f-13f932034e1e",
                                                "sense_id": "25e650f6-91c9-360a-8f80-1e599c52143e",
                                                "text": "Its overlapping steel plates and the empty hawseholes, from which the anchors will soon be suspended, are visible."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
